  "change_phrase_text": "edit PHR in tools/gianni12.py (new ones in NEW2 of tools/mkgianni12.py), run python3 tools/gianni12.py, rebuild. Keep index count at 137 or update phrase ranges + tables.",
  "add_phrase": "append to PHR (id 137+), add id to otab/xtab/ph_tab/jtab/ctab via rep() in patch_z.py; who-is-speaking is decided by id ranges in asm (search ph_d / range checks), update them too.",
  "change_timing": "rep() in patch_z.py on show_start (220+30*stage), pr_tab, xo_tab.",
  "verify": "0 vs-bad (VBlank overrun), no wrong char/phrase, check in PAL."
 },
